<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Steinzeug sells 75 pct of Friatec.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Steinzeug sells 75 pct of Friatec.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Steinzeug Cremer &amp; Breuer AG said on Friday that it had sold its 75 percent stake in Friatec AG Keramik- und Kunststoffwerke, Mannheim, to a group of investors for 280 million marks.</p>
<p>Deutsche Steinzeug said in a regulatory news release that the buyers were linked to the Ettlingen-based Flowtex group, but gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
